(3806005, 539630, 67258, '<td valign="top">Hmm, I would say it is something embedded in ice - a slice of apple perhaps?<br/>As far as voting goes, I am basing my score on the photos technical qualities and aesthetic appeal, combined with an attempt to meet the challenge. You have a really good tonal range here, with some interesting and pleasing textures; the focus is crisp in the centre and foreground.  I would have preferred the diagonal to be accenuated a little more by rotation a few degrees clockwise.<br/> <br/>Just revisited - I think it may be a slice of apple dropped in to running water?</td>', 'Hmm, I would say it is something embedded in ice - a slice of apple perhaps?As far as voting goes, I am basing my score on the photos technical qualities and aesthetic appeal, combined with an attempt to meet the challenge. You have a really good tonal range here, with some interesting and pleasing textures; the focus is crisp in the centre and foreground.  I would have preferred the diagonal to be accenuated a little more by rotation a few degrees clockwise. Just revisited - I think it may be a slice of apple dropped in to running water?', '2007-06-20 06:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
