(3806205, 538944, 60614, '<td valign="top">Cool macro.  I love the dark background.  It makes the edges of the subject pop.  Cool bokeh effect going on the top left.  First glance I thought it was three rings.  Tones fit well with what ever this is.  Great idea to use a diagonal composition.  A horizontal or vertical would not have had as much impact.  Hope it does well.</td>', 'Cool macro.  I love the dark background.  It makes the edges of the subject pop.  Cool bokeh effect going on the top left.  First glance I thought it was three rings.  Tones fit well with what ever this is.  Great idea to use a diagonal composition.  A horizontal or vertical would not have had as much impact.  Hope it does well.', '2007-06-20 08:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3806212, 537321, 51638, '<td valign="top">Your not gonna fool too many people with this one, but a good shot all the same.</td>', 'Your not gonna fool too many people with this one, but a good shot all the same.', '2007-06-20 08:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
