(3808694, 537659, 5112, '<td valign="top">Mardi-gras beads, or some other kind of beads?  It''s a good idea, and the colours are quite dramatic.  As an composition though, it is difficult to tell where the point of interest is - it''s like there''s colour all over, but not anything in particular to attract long-time attention or keep the viewer looking.  Your focus seems to be right at the left hand side of the image, the darkest section of the whole picture.  It might have been better to focus on a brighter, more attractive place, such as the green bead at the right towards the bottom.  ~5</td>', 'Mardi-gras beads, or some other kind of beads?  It''s a good idea, and the colours are quite dramatic.  As an composition though, it is difficult to tell where the point of interest is - it''s like there''s colour all over, but not anything in particular to attract long-time attention or keep the viewer looking.  Your focus seems to be right at the left hand side of the image, the darkest section of the whole picture.  It might have been better to focus on a brighter, more attractive place, such as the green bead at the right towards the bottom.  ~5', '2007-06-20 14:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
