(3814594, 540042, 76430, '<td valign="top">This is definitely woven, but very loose and it appears to be plastic strips, based on the reflectiveness of it.  I''d guess a decoration, like a wall-hanging clown face or something like that.  Nice shades of blue and DOF.</td>', 'This is definitely woven, but very loose and it appears to be plastic strips, based on the reflectiveness of it.  I''d guess a decoration, like a wall-hanging clown face or something like that.  Nice shades of blue and DOF.', '2007-06-21 11:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
