(3815581, 539536, 52500, '<td valign="top">A brush?  The stripe of rainbow color is nice, but I think there is just too much going on.  My eye never really lands anywhere.</td>', 'A brush?  The stripe of rainbow color is nice, but I think there is just too much going on.  My eye never really lands anywhere.', '2007-06-21 14:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
