(3815606, 538904, 52500, '<td valign="top">This photo is well taken, but that''s about it.  It''s not very abstract or puzzling.  Sure I don''t know exactly what engraved stone this is, but that''s what it is.  Using the max of 640 px on your longest side will help a lot.  I''m also confused by the white stripe down the right side.</td>', 'This photo is well taken, but that''s about it.  It''s not very abstract or puzzling.  Sure I don''t know exactly what engraved stone this is, but that''s what it is.  Using the max of 640 px on your longest side will help a lot.  I''m also confused by the white stripe down the right side.', '2007-06-21 14:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
