(3815790, 536647, 52500, '<td valign="top">Ha!  Funny title.  I certainly hope it has nothing to do with the object in the photo!  This is really cool looking.  I like the shallow DOF and the way the line of focus slices the photo diagonally.  Ice crystals on glass, perhaps a windshield of a car on a cold morning?</td>', 'Ha!  Funny title.  I certainly hope it has nothing to do with the object in the photo!  This is really cool looking.  I like the shallow DOF and the way the line of focus slices the photo diagonally.  Ice crystals on glass, perhaps a windshield of a car on a cold morning?', '2007-06-21 14:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
