(3818783, 538499, 17279, '<td valign="top">This is too uniform across the image for my tastes.  There''s no specific subject here and the texture alone is not strong enough to support this image without more.</td>', 'This is too uniform across the image for my tastes.  There''s no specific subject here and the texture alone is not strong enough to support this image without more.', '2007-06-22 01:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
