(3821382, 540207, 76430, '<td valign="top">It looks like a bunch of glasses filled with orange juice, but those are pretty rough edges.  I''d hate to venture guesses of what else it could be, like petri dishes stolen from the CDC, "specimin" containers for your physical exam or drunk driving test, or on the positive side, drawn butter for lobster.</td>', 'It looks like a bunch of glasses filled with orange juice, but those are pretty rough edges.  I''d hate to venture guesses of what else it could be, like petri dishes stolen from the CDC, "specimin" containers for your physical exam or drunk driving test, or on the positive side, drawn butter for lobster.', '2007-06-22 19:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3821392, 539470, 76430, '<td valign="top">Cheese grater with a blue light on it.  I got that idea from the forums, and since there is another one with the same object, is this DrAchoo?  Nice shot well composed and lit.  - 2   Just kidding, 7.</td>', 'Cheese grater with a blue light on it.  I got that idea from the forums, and since there is another one with the same object, is this DrAchoo?  Nice shot well composed and lit.  - 2   Just kidding, 7.', '2007-06-22 19:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3821400, 539094, 76430, '<td valign="top">Great shot of an ant.  I guess the puzzle is what he (or she) is on.  I''d say a painted over phillip''s screw.  If you need more specifics, based on the color I''d guess from Caterpiller equipment.</td>', 'Great shot of an ant.  I guess the puzzle is what he (or she) is on.  I''d say a painted over phillip''s screw.  If you need more specifics, based on the color I''d guess from Caterpiller equipment.', '2007-06-22 19:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3821428, 540193, 76430, '<td valign="top">A heating element.  Looke like one of two elements is on, so maybe it''s an air heater on low.  Good coloring and mysterious look.</td>', 'A heating element.  Looke like one of two elements is on, so maybe it''s an air heater on low.  Good coloring and mysterious look.', '2007-06-22 19:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
