(3821594, 535847, 65035, '<td valign="top">Wow that''s a lot of Ladybirds. This was a good find if only you''d been able to get in a little tighter, or if you could have taken it without the flash to keep the colours. The composition is nice, OK it''s not really macro but it''s still nice.</td>', 'Wow that''s a lot of Ladybirds. This was a good find if only you''d been able to get in a little tighter, or if you could have taken it without the flash to keep the colours. The composition is nice, OK it''s not really macro but it''s still nice.', '2007-06-22 20:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3821599, 540080, 47852, '<td valign="top">A red bit of candy stuck to some green candy after it came out of the freezer with some extra frost on it?  Yep, I''m stumped.  Nice contrast of colors though.</td>', 'A red bit of candy stuck to some green candy after it came out of the freezer with some extra frost on it?  Yep, I''m stumped.  Nice contrast of colors though.', '2007-06-22 20:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
