(3824053, 539660, 43774, '<td valign="top">A little bit too abstract and obscure maybe? It looks like light shining on something metallic, a pipe maybe? Of course it could also be a plant stem. Not interesting enough for the wow factor, not enough of the photo is in focus to be appealing, sorry.</td>', 'A little bit too abstract and obscure maybe? It looks like light shining on something metallic, a pipe maybe? Of course it could also be a plant stem. Not interesting enough for the wow factor, not enough of the photo is in focus to be appealing, sorry.', '2007-06-23 12:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3824055, 540078, 43774, '<td valign="top">There is another photo in this challenge of a similar item....hole in the middle, veins or branches radiating out and little bumps. I thought it might be a leaf but it''s not like any leaf I have seen. Then I thought a sea urchin, but the sea urchins I have seen don''t have those branches/veins. Maybe another type of shell? I think it''s a good idea for this challenge but your photo looks dull and washed out and not quite in focus. Improve on those things and you''d have a much better photo.</td>', 'There is another photo in this challenge of a similar item....hole in the middle, veins or branches radiating out and little bumps. I thought it might be a leaf but it''s not like any leaf I have seen. Then I thought a sea urchin, but the sea urchins I have seen don''t have those branches/veins. Maybe another type of shell? I think it''s a good idea for this challenge but your photo looks dull and washed out and not quite in focus. Improve on those things and you''d have a much better photo.', '2007-06-23 12:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3824056, 537386, 43774, '<td valign="top">No idea. That looks like window blinds in the background, this is either a light source or has a light shining in it. I wish it were sharper.</td>', 'No idea. That looks like window blinds in the background, this is either a light source or has a light shining in it. I wish it were sharper.', '2007-06-23 12:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3824057, 539198, 43774, '<td valign="top">This looks like the beginnings of a flower or other type of plant. I wish it were a bit bigger. It looks like you shot this in harsh sunlight, it might be better to shoot it on an overcast day to give it a softer feel.</td>', 'This looks like the beginnings of a flower or other type of plant. I wish it were a bit bigger. It looks like you shot this in harsh sunlight, it might be better to shoot it on an overcast day to give it a softer feel.', '2007-06-23 12:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
