(3824195, 535719, 43774, '<td valign="top">Bubble wrap on the bottom? Not sure what the tube like thing is, there''s a coil inside, is it a lightbulb? I like the colour but I wish it were more in focus.</td>', 'Bubble wrap on the bottom? Not sure what the tube like thing is, there''s a coil inside, is it a lightbulb? I like the colour but I wish it were more in focus.', '2007-06-23 12:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
