(3824205, 540174, 43774, '<td valign="top">I wasn''t sure what this was but then I saw a photo of a pineapple in this challenge and this looks like a piece of the outside of a pineapple. The way you took the photo it looks like a moth, which is clever. I do wish it were in focus though.....more DOF would really help.<br/> <br/>Can I have one more guess? If it''s not from the outside of a pineapple I think it might be from a pine cone.</td>', 'I wasn''t sure what this was but then I saw a photo of a pineapple in this challenge and this looks like a piece of the outside of a pineapple. The way you took the photo it looks like a moth, which is clever. I do wish it were in focus though.....more DOF would really help. Can I have one more guess? If it''s not from the outside of a pineapple I think it might be from a pine cone.', '2007-06-23 12:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3824207, 540168, 43774, '<td valign="top">Looks like a twisted glass or plastic item, like a swizzle stick. It''s a bit dark and dull, better lighting might help.</td>', 'Looks like a twisted glass or plastic item, like a swizzle stick. It''s a bit dark and dull, better lighting might help.', '2007-06-23 12:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
