(3832693, 538671, 72318, '<td valign="top">"This photo has been validated." - i get why they might have requested this as it looks like something painted in photoshop ;) I think the white space at the top conflicts with the bit at the bottom left and a crop from the top would benefit it. But that is looking at it from a peice of art rather than a photograph, and in this instance i am voting on a photograph and it is just a bit too much out of the comfort zone of leniancy in voting, but still it has it''s merits. As for what it is... white peices of paper curled up and put on something black, inverted and contrasted to death? ;)</td>', '"This photo has been validated." - i get why they might have requested this as it looks like something painted in photoshop ;) I think the white space at the top conflicts with the bit at the bottom left and a crop from the top would benefit it. But that is looking at it from a peice of art rather than a photograph, and in this instance i am voting on a photograph and it is just a bit too much out of the comfort zone of leniancy in voting, but still it has it''s merits. As for what it is... white peices of paper curled up and put on something black, inverted and contrasted to death? ;)', '2007-06-25 16:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
