(3833763, 536773, 25095, '<td valign="top">It does kind of remind me of my visit to the great sand dunes except I''m not sweating my butt off and my shoes aren''t full of sand lol.  Appears to be a pillow or couch cushion of some sort.  Great job of using shadows and lights to make the viewer see something extra-ordinary.  I do however think your DOF blurred the foreground just a tad to much making it less like an actual landscape but it really isn''t that big if a deal, just my opinion.</td>', 'It does kind of remind me of my visit to the great sand dunes except I''m not sweating my butt off and my shoes aren''t full of sand lol.  Appears to be a pillow or couch cushion of some sort.  Great job of using shadows and lights to make the viewer see something extra-ordinary.  I do however think your DOF blurred the foreground just a tad to much making it less like an actual landscape but it really isn''t that big if a deal, just my opinion.', '2007-06-25 21:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
