(3834058, 540137, 25095, '<td valign="top">looks like an eyeball floating in a fish tank lol.  cool colors and lighting.</td>', 'looks like an eyeball floating in a fish tank lol.  cool colors and lighting.', '2007-06-25 22:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834089, 539569, 25095, '<td valign="top">I''ve looked at your image a couple times and was first thinking of a table saw (or similar) fence but I don''t think I''ve ever seen one this fancy so I''m most likly way off.  I love the gold tones to the image even though some of it seems to be made of wood.  Nice sharp edges and details and the depth of field draws you attention in but also allows it to wander about without getting lost or bored.  Nice job.</td>', 'I''ve looked at your image a couple times and was first thinking of a table saw (or similar) fence but I don''t think I''ve ever seen one this fancy so I''m most likly way off.  I love the gold tones to the image even though some of it seems to be made of wood.  Nice sharp edges and details and the depth of field draws you attention in but also allows it to wander about without getting lost or bored.  Nice job.', '2007-06-25 22:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834098, 536374, 25095, '<td valign="top">on the "eww that''s gross" level it looks like someones spine has just been removed.  I''m guess closer to some sort of pasta in a red sauce.  I think it could be a bit sharper and the image is a little too bright in the bottom right quarter.  Nice job of getting up and personal.</td>', 'on the "eww that''s gross" level it looks like someones spine has just been removed.  I''m guess closer to some sort of pasta in a red sauce.  I think it could be a bit sharper and the image is a little too bright in the bottom right quarter.  Nice job of getting up and personal.', '2007-06-25 22:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834107, 539243, 25095, '<td valign="top">cool!  I''m guessing it''s one of those flat circular things that lets off colored lightning bolts and you can touch causing the bolts to go where you touch.  Never looked at one so close, adds a totally different perspective.  The black specks are a little annoying but I know totally unavoidable since it is part of the actual item.  Nice variety of colors.</td>', 'cool!  I''m guessing it''s one of those flat circular things that lets off colored lightning bolts and you can touch causing the bolts to go where you touch.  Never looked at one so close, adds a totally different perspective.  The black specks are a little annoying but I know totally unavoidable since it is part of the actual item.  Nice variety of colors.', '2007-06-25 22:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834116, 539168, 25095, '<td valign="top">Maybe easy to guess but I''m guess not really easy to capture...at least not to your quality.  The colors are right where I''d expect them, nice white whites.  Cool how you caught some of the center parts in different phases of growth...would have been a great transistion submission but better here.  Well done.</td>', 'Maybe easy to guess but I''m guess not really easy to capture...at least not to your quality.  The colors are right where I''d expect them, nice white whites.  Cool how you caught some of the center parts in different phases of growth...would have been a great transistion submission but better here.  Well done.', '2007-06-25 22:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834123, 538564, 25095, '<td valign="top">When I first think of macro I think of extreme close up but you have made me change my mind.  This shows some nice detail without showing the entire image.  Still not as puzzling as I expect in this challenge but an over all nicely captured image.  The lighting is excellent and sharpeness is sharp! Nice job.</td>', 'When I first think of macro I think of extreme close up but you have made me change my mind.  This shows some nice detail without showing the entire image.  Still not as puzzling as I expect in this challenge but an over all nicely captured image.  The lighting is excellent and sharpeness is sharp! Nice job.', '2007-06-25 23:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
