(3835224, 536511, 4207, '<td valign="top">I would like to see the subject in sharp focus. It seems that the bottom of the bead is nt quite in focus but a USM sharpening utility was used to recover the sharpness, but nothing replaces a nice wide DOF.  I do like the color scheme though. Good job.</td>', 'I would like to see the subject in sharp focus. It seems that the bottom of the bead is nt quite in focus but a USM sharpening utility was used to recover the sharpness, but nothing replaces a nice wide DOF.  I do like the color scheme though. Good job.', '2007-06-26 05:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835226, 540165, 4207, '<td valign="top">This image has a subject but could use some sharpness and a tighter crop. That''s the beauty of Macro Photography to me... being able to see textures that ordinarily unnoticed.</td>', 'This image has a subject but could use some sharpness and a tighter crop. That''s the beauty of Macro Photography to me... being able to see textures that ordinarily unnoticed.', '2007-06-26 05:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835228, 537200, 4207, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Macro. The lines in the BG distract a bit to me a bit.</td>', 'Very nice. Macro. The lines in the BG distract a bit to me a bit.', '2007-06-26 05:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835231, 539638, 4207, '<td valign="top">It seems these shots work well when you can see a secondary subject in the water droplets. I don''t recognize anything in the BG to make the effect pop.</td>', 'It seems these shots work well when you can see a secondary subject in the water droplets. I don''t recognize anything in the BG to make the effect pop.', '2007-06-26 05:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835235, 535894, 4207, '<td valign="top">The image does have technical merit but, to be honest, the subject isn''t very interesting to me.</td>', 'The image does have technical merit but, to be honest, the subject isn''t very interesting to me.', '2007-06-26 05:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835243, 539569, 4207, '<td valign="top">It seems the DOF is shallow for no apparent reason. The DOF draws my eye to the circular area on the right but once my eyes land there, there''s nothing very cool to see (relatively speaking). For this image i think a nice wide DOF would work nicely so that we can see the detail in the entire frame and perhaps to add some dynamics, add a lens vignette. my 2 cents</td>', 'It seems the DOF is shallow for no apparent reason. The DOF draws my eye to the circular area on the right but once my eyes land there, there''s nothing very cool to see (relatively speaking). For this image i think a nice wide DOF would work nicely so that we can see the detail in the entire frame and perhaps to add some dynamics, add a lens vignette. my 2 cents', '2007-06-26 05:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835248, 540137, 4207, '<td valign="top">For some reason, i feel like i''ve seen this image somewhere before. Is this similar to a previous image/challenge? In any-case, nice execution.</td>', 'For some reason, i feel like i''ve seen this image somewhere before. Is this similar to a previous image/challenge? In any-case, nice execution.', '2007-06-26 05:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835259, 540103, 4207, '<td valign="top">There''s an inconsistancy: The subject pulls my eye to the section where the dough/stuff is pulling apart, but the DOF trying to pull my eye to the upper right hand corner. and the lighting seems to yank my eye to the bottom right. It seems to me that if you get all these elements to work together, then they''ll combine forces and make this image awesome. IMHO</td>', 'There''s an inconsistancy: The subject pulls my eye to the section where the dough/stuff is pulling apart, but the DOF trying to pull my eye to the upper right hand corner. and the lighting seems to yank my eye to the bottom right. It seems to me that if you get all these elements to work together, then they''ll combine forces and make this image awesome. IMHO', '2007-06-26 05:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835261, 540208, 4207, '<td valign="top">Yarn. I would like to see a bit more detail in the threads, but i understand this must be terribly difficult to shoot.</td>', 'Yarn. I would like to see a bit more detail in the threads, but i understand this must be terribly difficult to shoot.', '2007-06-26 05:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835265, 538775, 4207, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract of a feather. (guess) I like.</td>', 'Interesting abstract of a feather. (guess) I like.', '2007-06-26 06:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835267, 536345, 4207, '<td valign="top">This image really works for me, the wight accents add a unique flavor to the image.</td>', 'This image really works for me, the wight accents add a unique flavor to the image.', '2007-06-26 06:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835271, 538606, 4207, '<td valign="top">Meat pulverizer... I like the lighting I can''t seem to put my finger on it, but the image just isn''t popping for me for some reason.</td>', 'Meat pulverizer... I like the lighting I can''t seem to put my finger on it, but the image just isn''t popping for me for some reason.', '2007-06-26 06:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835273, 537552, 4207, '<td valign="top">The reflections in the metal distract from the image. Perhaps a large softbox/bounceboard would remedy this issue.</td>', 'The reflections in the metal distract from the image. Perhaps a large softbox/bounceboard would remedy this issue.', '2007-06-26 06:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835276, 537511, 4207, '<td valign="top">Great image.</td>', 'Great image.', '2007-06-26 06:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835280, 539150, 4207, '<td valign="top">This image has a subject but could use some sharpness. That''s the beauty of Macro Photography to me... being able to see textures that ordinarily unnoticed. The grain in the photo isn''t my taste, but i think it would work a little better if it were reduced. It''s a little distracting to me.</td>', 'This image has a subject but could use some sharpness. That''s the beauty of Macro Photography to me... being able to see textures that ordinarily unnoticed. The grain in the photo isn''t my taste, but i think it would work a little better if it were reduced. It''s a little distracting to me.', '2007-06-26 06:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835284, 539714, 4207, '<td valign="top">Nice job with lighting to pull the textures out. I personally would like to see the subject photographed straight on to accent the symmetry of the subject. The DOF also seems a hair off.</td>', 'Nice job with lighting to pull the textures out. I personally would like to see the subject photographed straight on to accent the symmetry of the subject. The DOF also seems a hair off.', '2007-06-26 06:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835287, 537739, 4207, '<td valign="top">The subject of the photo doesn''t seem to be a macro.</td>', 'The subject of the photo doesn''t seem to be a macro.', '2007-06-26 06:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835292, 540020, 4207, '<td valign="top">We''re loosing texture in the highlights. I''m not sure what the subject of the photo is. Where should my eye be drawn?</td>', 'We''re loosing texture in the highlights. I''m not sure what the subject of the photo is. Where should my eye be drawn?', '2007-06-26 06:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835298, 535902, 4207, '<td valign="top">Rubberband ball - Great idea for a subject, but the lighting needs to be kicked up a notch, to me (I''m thinking a big ole softbox would do the trick) and the DOF is a bit shallow to really see the detail of the subject.</td>', 'Rubberband ball - Great idea for a subject, but the lighting needs to be kicked up a notch, to me (I''m thinking a big ole softbox would do the trick) and the DOF is a bit shallow to really see the detail of the subject.', '2007-06-26 06:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835301, 539205, 4207, '<td valign="top">My eye doesn''t know where to go? What''s the subject of the photo?</td>', 'My eye doesn''t know where to go? What''s the subject of the photo?', '2007-06-26 06:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835302, 540144, 4207, '<td valign="top">I like!</td>', 'I like!', '2007-06-26 06:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835303, 539196, 4207, '<td valign="top">Wow, nice image. Great example of a clear subject.</td>', 'Wow, nice image. Great example of a clear subject.', '2007-06-26 06:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835307, 539225, 4207, '<td valign="top">The composition and executing is good, but i think I''m a bit bored by the subject itself. Maybe a wider DOF would make this image pop off the screen.</td>', 'The composition and executing is good, but i think I''m a bit bored by the subject itself. Maybe a wider DOF would make this image pop off the screen.', '2007-06-26 06:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835309, 535714, 4207, '<td valign="top">Ha, not really a macro but a great shot of a playground spiral thingy.</td>', 'Ha, not really a macro but a great shot of a playground spiral thingy.', '2007-06-26 06:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835312, 538078, 4207, '<td valign="top">Cool. I like the execution/lighting.</td>', 'Cool. I like the execution/lighting.', '2007-06-26 06:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835320, 539002, 4207, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but i think this image needs a subject. Is it "Look how pointy these jagged things are?" In that case really get up close and show the jagged things. Or is it "Look at how colorful this flower is" In that case really get a angle that displays that. To me this image doesn''t have a point of view. It needs a subject. IMHO</td>', 'I like the idea, but i think this image needs a subject. Is it "Look how pointy these jagged things are?" In that case really get up close and show the jagged things. Or is it "Look at how colorful this flower is" In that case really get a angle that displays that. To me this image doesn''t have a point of view. It needs a subject. IMHO', '2007-06-26 06:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835323, 539053, 4207, '<td valign="top">NIce! I think the image needs to be flattened a bit lighting wise so the highlights and shadows still carry some information, but most of all I think this image could benefit from a wider DOF to get the seashell''s texture without over-sharpening.</td>', 'NIce! I think the image needs to be flattened a bit lighting wise so the highlights and shadows still carry some information, but most of all I think this image could benefit from a wider DOF to get the seashell''s texture without over-sharpening.', '2007-06-26 06:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835325, 537079, 4207, '<td valign="top">I like. Very interesting optical illusion.</td>', 'I like. Very interesting optical illusion.', '2007-06-26 06:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835326, 538416, 4207, '<td valign="top">Man, this is a interesting image but not a macro shot:(</td>', 'Man, this is a interesting image but not a macro shot:(', '2007-06-26 06:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835328, 537592, 4207, '<td valign="top">The image is a little busy for my taste and the light seems a bit harsh which really makes your lens show chromatic aberration. I would suggest either softening the light a ton or play around more with lighting technique or subjects.</td>', 'The image is a little busy for my taste and the light seems a bit harsh which really makes your lens show chromatic aberration. I would suggest either softening the light a ton or play around more with lighting technique or subjects.', '2007-06-26 06:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835331, 538499, 4207, '<td valign="top">This image needs a subject. What in this image am i suppose to "See". The texture of the subject? If so, widen the DOF and let''s really see that texture. It feels like a digital crop and the subject itself isn''t very interesting IMHO</td>', 'This image needs a subject. What in this image am i suppose to "See". The texture of the subject? If so, widen the DOF and let''s really see that texture. It feels like a digital crop and the subject itself isn''t very interesting IMHO', '2007-06-26 06:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
