(3839229, 537386, 66041, '<td valign="top">Hey, thanks for entering.   Composition isn''t bad.   But your main subject is out of focus.  If it were crisp it would have complimented the background with some ''depth of field'' creativity.   Not sure if some lighting work would have done anything...     This looks more like a snapshot than a photograph.   Looking forward to seeing your next entry.</td>', 'Hey, thanks for entering.   Composition isn''t bad.   But your main subject is out of focus.  If it were crisp it would have complimented the background with some ''depth of field'' creativity.   Not sure if some lighting work would have done anything...     This looks more like a snapshot than a photograph.   Looking forward to seeing your next entry.', '2007-06-27 00:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
