(3839297, 540020, 25095, '<td valign="top">well from the thumbnail view I was gonna guess you colored some cauliflower but now it looks like something totally different...just not sure.  It appears to have a slight curved shape and it is really thowing me off cause I was first thinking it was like a pathway or something like that.  Please just tell me it isn''t a close up of someones tongue and taste buds.</td>', 'well from the thumbnail view I was gonna guess you colored some cauliflower but now it looks like something totally different...just not sure.  It appears to have a slight curved shape and it is really thowing me off cause I was first thinking it was like a pathway or something like that.  Please just tell me it isn''t a close up of someones tongue and taste buds.', '2007-06-27 00:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3839302, 538919, 25095, '<td valign="top">it''s a CHICKEN!  Man how did you get this close without having your own eye poked out?  When I was little we raised them and my sister would make my little brother and I kneel down and she would put food on our head so the chickens would peck it off lol, was fun for a little while, till they got aggressive. :)</td>', 'it''s a CHICKEN!  Man how did you get this close without having your own eye poked out?  When I was little we raised them and my sister would make my little brother and I kneel down and she would put food on our head so the chickens would peck it off lol, was fun for a little while, till they got aggressive. :)', '2007-06-27 00:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
