(3840070, 539623, 78255, '<td valign="top">I was sure that no one would be able to guess what this macro was of, which was the whole point of this challenge to me. But Quigley guessed it. Even with your explanation via e-mail I am still impressed that you knew this was a light diffuser for florescent lights. Thank you all for guessing and leaving comments. This was my most gratifying of all the challenges I''ve entered thus far because of the comments. Again, thank you all for taking the time!</td>', 'I was sure that no one would be able to guess what this macro was of, which was the whole point of this challenge to me. But Quigley guessed it. Even with your explanation via e-mail I am still impressed that you knew this was a light diffuser for florescent lights. Thank you all for guessing and leaving comments. This was my most gratifying of all the challenges I''ve entered thus far because of the comments. Again, thank you all for taking the time!', '2007-06-27 02:54:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(3840074, 539824, 59267, '<td valign="top">Wow 7.5279! excellent! Congratulations!!</td>', 'Wow 7.5279! excellent! Congratulations!!', '2007-06-27 02:57:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(3840087, 536345, 66398, '<td valign="top">congratulations Doc. I gave it a 10. What was the pp?</td>', 'congratulations Doc. I gave it a 10. What was the pp?', '2007-06-27 03:02:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(3840092, 539824, 15711, '<td valign="top">WOO HOO, Richard.  Way to go man.  I didn''t vote this one but this is outstanding. Congrats.</td>', 'WOO HOO, Richard.  Way to go man.  I didn''t vote this one but this is outstanding. Congrats.', '2007-06-27 03:04:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(3840096, 539824, 43405, '<td valign="top">Yep, definitely worthy of the Ribbon.</td>', 'Yep, definitely worthy of the Ribbon.', '2007-06-27 03:05:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(3840097, 539534, 32872, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic..I agree!!  This reminds me of a "Rothko" painting.  Gosh I hope I spelled his name right.  Love this image.</td>', 'This is fantastic..I agree!!  This reminds me of a "Rothko" painting.  Gosh I hope I spelled his name right.  Love this image.', '2007-06-27 03:06:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(3840098, 539824, 40718, '<td valign="top">So Richard turns out to be a closet Nina fan.  Congrats man!  Great score.  I knew it would hold up.</td>', 'So Richard turns out to be a closet Nina fan.  Congrats man!  Great score.  I knew it would hold up.', '2007-06-27 03:06:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(3840105, 538089, 40718, '<td valign="top">Welcome to 4th place.  Awesome colors!</td>', 'Welcome to 4th place.  Awesome colors!', '2007-06-27 03:10:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(3840106, 539570, 20324, '<td valign="top">Congratulation on top 20 finish.</td>', 'Congratulation on top 20 finish.', '2007-06-27 03:10:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(3840115, 536675, 50641, '<td valign="top">I happen to think anything goes with abstracts, but you''ll find that this crowd wants sharp even in a soft focus challenge.  To me, your photo looks like ambient music sounds - and it seems to bob in and out of its dimensions. I really like it - got a 7 from me, and you have quite a few other high votes mixed in there.  Sometimes a small quirky audience is better than an army of kneejerkers :)</td>', 'I happen to think anything goes with abstracts, but you''ll find that this crowd wants sharp even in a soft focus challenge.  To me, your photo looks like ambient music sounds - and it seems to bob in and out of its dimensions. I really like it - got a 7 from me, and you have quite a few other high votes mixed in there.  Sometimes a small quirky audience is better than an army of kneejerkers :)', '2007-06-27 03:13:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(3840127, 538089, 28742, '<td valign="top">Sweetness Jimmy! Congrats!</td>', 'Sweetness Jimmy! Congrats!', '2007-06-27 03:18:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(3840149, 540048, 59267, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!!</td>', 'Congratulations!!', '2007-06-27 03:24:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(3840153, 540200, 28742, '<td valign="top">Bones?? Nice job! Woulda been a good one for personification also.</td>', 'Bones?? Nice job! Woulda been a good one for personification also.', '2007-06-27 03:24:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(3840165, 539725, 28742, '<td valign="top">Useless maybe, but makes a nice macro! Your estimate was off a bit and a near-6 is a highly respectable score these days. I noticed people with no camera REALLY loved it. ...I don''t know how to interpret that though. :/</td>', 'Useless maybe, but makes a nice macro! Your estimate was off a bit and a near-6 is a highly respectable score these days. I noticed people with no camera REALLY loved it. ...I don''t know how to interpret that though. :/', '2007-06-27 03:27:16.000000', NULL, 0);
