(3840324, 539168, 78396, '<td valign="top">Sorry, it''s not a toaster :-)<br/> <br/>Yes, it was easy, but nobody got it: Leucanthemum vulgare :-P<br/> <br/>Maybe not a great puzzle, but it''s a macro for sure: I shot this with a 50mm macro at 1:2 with an extension tube, so the magnification is at least 1:1.<br/> <br/>I also tried a thighter crop but the composition was not so good and finally I decided to go with this one.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-06-27 03:48:46.</i></td>', 'Sorry, it''s not a toaster :-) Yes, it was easy, but nobody got it: Leucanthemum vulgare :-P Maybe not a great puzzle, but it''s a macro for sure: I shot this with a 50mm macro at 1:2 with an extension tube, so the magnification is at least 1:1. I also tried a thighter crop but the composition was not so good and finally I decided to go with this one.', '2007-06-27 04:44:26.000000', '2007-06-27 04:48:46.000000', 0),
(3840326, 539470, 71239, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the guesses and comments everyone, I treated this shot as a challenge in trying to obscure an object based mainly on the lighting rather than an unusual viewpoint.</td>', 'Thanks for all the guesses and comments everyone, I treated this shot as a challenge in trying to obscure an object based mainly on the lighting rather than an unusual viewpoint.', '2007-06-27 04:45:11.000000', NULL, 0),
