(3840777, 536345, 66597, '<td valign="top">Well, Doc, guess we really were doing the score tango on this one :-) I figured one of the anemone shots might be yours, since you live close to the coast. I''m surprised the salsify are already going to seed out your way - I grew up in MT and salsify were a late July / early Aug thing. Guess Oregon''s milder climate brings things out earlier. Anyway, nice color treatment - really makes it look like a flower.</td>', 'Well, Doc, guess we really were doing the score tango on this one :-) I figured one of the anemone shots might be yours, since you live close to the coast. I''m surprised the salsify are already going to seed out your way - I grew up in MT and salsify were a late July / early Aug thing. Guess Oregon''s milder climate brings things out earlier. Anyway, nice color treatment - really makes it look like a flower.', '2007-06-27 09:14:01.000000', NULL, 0),
