(3844444, 539725, 42013, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Art Roflmao:</b></div><hr/><i> Useless maybe, but makes a nice macro! Your estimate was off a bit and a near-6 is a highly respectable score these days. I noticed people with no camera REALLY loved it. ...I don''t know how to interpret that though. :/ </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Ghost accounts ;P  I''m with Karen, still don''t know what it is...</td>', 'Originally posted by Art Roflmao: Useless maybe, but makes a nice macro! Your estimate was off a bit and a near-6 is a highly respectable score these days. I noticed people with no camera REALLY loved it. ...I don''t know how to interpret that though. :/   Ghost accounts ;P  I''m with Karen, still don''t know what it is...', '2007-06-28 03:05:10.000000', NULL, 0),
