(3845378, 536461, 2217, '<td valign="top">Congrats Ursula.  Well done.</td>', 'Congrats Ursula.  Well done.', '2007-06-28 14:00:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(3845539, 540181, 37320, '<td valign="top">Nice work!  I woulda never guessed, makes a cool image too.</td>', 'Nice work!  I woulda never guessed, makes a cool image too.', '2007-06-28 14:52:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(3845734, 540048, 31399, '<td valign="top">beautiful image! meets challenge perfectly and well executed....strolls off doing gwen stefani (sp?)...yeewhooo...woohoooo....yeeehoooo...wooohooo<br/> <br/>what a femme fetale'' you are ! congrats!!!!</td>', 'beautiful image! meets challenge perfectly and well executed....strolls off doing gwen stefani (sp?)...yeewhooo...woohoooo....yeeehoooo...wooohooo what a femme fetale'' you are ! congrats!!!!', '2007-06-28 16:27:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(3845752, 539824, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very creative, very sophisticated!  Congrats on the ribbon!</td>', 'Very creative, very sophisticated!  Congrats on the ribbon!', '2007-06-28 16:36:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(3845755, 538089, 30982, '<td valign="top">Aptly titled (and with the British/Canadian spelling as well) for a lovely capture of color.  Congrats on the "green" ribbon, aka the DrAchoo ribbon.  :-)</td>', 'Aptly titled (and with the British/Canadian spelling as well) for a lovely capture of color.  Congrats on the "green" ribbon, aka the DrAchoo ribbon.  :-)', '2007-06-28 16:37:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(3845762, 537388, 30982, '<td valign="top">You''re just kickin'' butt and taking names these days, woman!  Very impressive.  Congrats on the new #2.  Everything on your top row (I show seven across) is recent.  Really a tribute to the effort you''ve put forth.</td>', 'You''re just kickin'' butt and taking names these days, woman!  Very impressive.  Congrats on the new #2.  Everything on your top row (I show seven across) is recent.  Really a tribute to the effort you''ve put forth.', '2007-06-28 16:41:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(3845769, 536595, 30982, '<td valign="top">A fascinating image to me - but I''m a geeky engineer type.  Still I think it''s well done, and I love the story that goes with it!</td>', 'A fascinating image to me - but I''m a geeky engineer type.  Still I think it''s well done, and I love the story that goes with it!', '2007-06-28 16:43:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(3845772, 537552, 30982, '<td valign="top">A good strong composition and I quite like the blue - I''d have thought you toned it that way but it appears it''s a blue clothes peg!  Note that all the US-based commenters call it a clothes pin (which is also what I know it as, seeing as how I''m really not from Germany).  You''re doing very well - keep it up!</td>', 'A good strong composition and I quite like the blue - I''d have thought you toned it that way but it appears it''s a blue clothes peg!  Note that all the US-based commenters call it a clothes pin (which is also what I know it as, seeing as how I''m really not from Germany).  You''re doing very well - keep it up!', '2007-06-28 16:44:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(3845774, 539053, 30982, '<td valign="top">All the work paid off nicely - an excellent image!  Nice to see you having such fun with the new toy, too.</td>', 'All the work paid off nicely - an excellent image!  Nice to see you having such fun with the new toy, too.', '2007-06-28 16:45:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(3845777, 539002, 30982, '<td valign="top">A captured galaxy, rimmed in yellow and red.  Quite intriguing!</td>', 'A captured galaxy, rimmed in yellow and red.  Quite intriguing!', '2007-06-28 16:46:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3845785, 538743, 30982, '<td valign="top">Cool!  I love the blue and I''d not have figured what it is.  I also like how all the dots/circles are balanced by the straight edges and corners.  And seems you stumped the majority!</td>', 'Cool!  I love the blue and I''d not have figured what it is.  I also like how all the dots/circles are balanced by the straight edges and corners.  And seems you stumped the majority!', '2007-06-28 16:47:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(3845787, 539780, 30982, '<td valign="top">I don''t find the green unpleasant, and can''t tell you why it went flat.  I like the haspy thing, especially with it''s shadow, which seems to drip down and run out of the picture.</td>', 'I don''t find the green unpleasant, and can''t tell you why it went flat.  I like the haspy thing, especially with it''s shadow, which seems to drip down and run out of the picture.', '2007-06-28 16:49:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(3845792, 540022, 30982, '<td valign="top">Fascinating!!  I''d never have know that.  I see a couple of folks got it and you got some really interesting guesses, too.</td>', 'Fascinating!!  I''d never have know that.  I see a couple of folks got it and you got some really interesting guesses, too.', '2007-06-28 16:51:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(3845796, 536652, 30982, '<td valign="top">I really like this - I love the shallow DOF, the metallic feel, and the sense of motion created here.  An excellent macro and a very nicely constructed photograph!</td>', 'I really like this - I love the shallow DOF, the metallic feel, and the sense of motion created here.  An excellent macro and a very nicely constructed photograph!', '2007-06-28 16:52:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(3845802, 539448, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''d have guessed what Lori guessed - I thought they were some sort of clips of some kind.  I like the "design" formed by looping it around on itself - they kinda look like swings or chairs that way.</td>', 'I''d have guessed what Lori guessed - I thought they were some sort of clips of some kind.  I like the "design" formed by looping it around on itself - they kinda look like swings or chairs that way.', '2007-06-28 16:54:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(3845809, 538416, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice!!  You''ve created something completely different than what the normal eye would see - the result is very pleasing.</td>', 'Very nice!!  You''ve created something completely different than what the normal eye would see - the result is very pleasing.', '2007-06-28 16:57:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(3845813, 539849, 30982, '<td valign="top">Dang, not only a pretty darn fascinating picture (quite nicely done) but a bitchin'' way cool science lesson to go with it.</td>', 'Dang, not only a pretty darn fascinating picture (quite nicely done) but a bitchin'' way cool science lesson to go with it.', '2007-06-28 16:58:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(3845819, 539137, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!  It''s really cool as you scroll down to comment.  Then scroll up, then down.  It moves!  I like the curves and color in this.</td>', 'Heh!  It''s really cool as you scroll down to comment.  Then scroll up, then down.  It moves!  I like the curves and color in this.', '2007-06-28 17:00:06.000000', NULL, 0),
